<role_specific_rules>
INTRO

Fail if any are true:
- Opens with generic/SEO-first framing (e.g. “Looking for…”, “If you’re looking for…”, “In this guide…”, “Best X for Y?” as the opener).
- Does not create immediate recognition of the reader’s frustration.
- Does not answer the core search intent within the first 2–3 sentences (semantic phrasing allowed).
- Mentions products, brands, pricing, or selling language.
- Overpromises (guarantees, instant results, medical certainty).
</role_specific_rules>
